   \sum_{j \in P} w_j x_{ij} \leq C_i
   \]

2. **Nonnegativity and integrality:**
   \[
   x_{ij} \in \mathbb{Z}_{\geq 0} \quad \forall i \in S,\, j \in P
   \]

